      "Supported service interface and caller identity/permission binding",
      "Fresh residual parent/socket/child and attempt ownership before any future execution",
      "Preserved refusal, unknown, duplicate-request and existing-child negative cases",
      "Exact source/build provenance and separately reviewed recovery boundary"
    ],
    "not_proposed": [
      "automatic init restart",
      "clearing old locks/stops/attempt directories",
      "observer JSON as authority",
      "bypassing identity refusal",
      "T38 orchestration"
